VMX import map
==============

Source input:
  sys/dev/virtual/nvmm/x86/nvmm_x86_vmx.c
  sys/dev/virtual/nvmm/x86/nvmm_x86_vmxfunc.S
  sys/dev/virtual/nvmm/x86/nvmm_x86.h
  sys/dev/virtual/nvmm/x86/nvmm_x86_internal.h

VMM outputs:
  vmm_vmx.c          VMX hardware backend and VMM backend registration
  vmm_vmx_entry.S    VMLAUNCH/VMRESUME assembly wrapper
  vmm_vmx_os.h       DragonFly OS adaptation boundary
  vmm_vmx_x86defs.h  x86 constants retained under VMM names
  vmm_vmx.h          VMM backend declarations

Deliberate VMM boundary changes:
  - VMM owns no NVMM communication page.  The caller-owned vmm_cpustate is
    loaded before each public run and written back after it returns.
  - Exact VMM CPUID entries replace NVMM's mask-or-exit configuration API.
  - VMX exposes no irqchip in this import.  Software irqchip and APICv are
    independent follow-up work, not hidden in this backend.
  - EPT uses the caller-provided machine vmspace, which VMM transforms during
    machine creation.
